UnitCLFactory::SetDiscountRegistryManager
├── when caller isn't discount registry manager
│   └── it reverts with NotDiscountRegistryManager
└── when caller is discount registry manager
    ├── when new discount registry manager is address zero
    │   └── it reverts with DiscountRegistryManagerIsZero
    └── when new discount registry manager isn't address zero
        ├── it sets discountRegistryManager to new discountRegistryManager
        └── it emits DiscountRegistryManagerChanged
